   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜たことがあります: experience",
     "texto": [
      "To say that you have **ever** done something: past verb + **こと が あります**: **にほん に いった こと が あります** (I have been to Japan).",
      "To say you have **never** done it: **〜た こと が ありません** (I have never...)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜たり〜たり します: alternating actions",
     "texto": [
      "To list some actions without saying all of them: **えいが を みたり、 かいもの を したり します** (sometimes I watch films, sometimes I go shopping).",
      "It's formed from the past without た: **みたり**, **したり**, **よんだり**. It's used at the end to say that several things are done."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
